flowchart TD
    S[Source: generation excluded] --> P[Parse and intern]
    P --> K[Resolve constants]
    K --> C[Borrow cached root AST]
    C --> I[Index and aliases]
    I --> L[Lower references: resolve values once]
    L --> W[Reuse resolved values for weights; preserve IR layout]
    L --> H[Canonical structure hash; build canonical paths once]
    H --> N[Validate namespace and hash using shared paths]
    N --> E[Compact Pruefer: degree and neighbor XOR]
    E --> R[Compiled program cache]
    H --> CI[CanonicalIncidence: one record order and encoder]
    CI --> CS[Output trait]
    H --> CP[CanonicalPrufer owns SkeletonForest and labels]
    CP --> SF[Reverse root-first fold; shared sorting buffer and leaf hashes]
    H --> CFG[CanonHashCfg owns header and chunk hashing]
    H --> PATHS[CanonicalPaths owns path construction]
    PATHS --> NV[NamespaceValidator borrows paths for boundary checks]
    CP --> PT[PruferTraversal implements Iterator]
    PT --> CS
    CS --> CB[bytes: Vec of u8]
    CS --> CH[hash: CanonicalHasher batches into fixed 16 KiB BLAKE3 input]
    R --> Q[Prepared execution]
    C -.profile.-> D[Choose measurable optimization]
    L -.profile.-> D
    H -.profile.-> D
    D --> V[Parity + before/after latency and memory]
    IR[SignedRefR] --> RM[target and sign methods; free duplicates removed]
    AS[TransactionAssembler: seven staging limit guards] --> SL[One staging_limit_exceeded outcome constructor]
    SL --> AB[apply abandons pending state; retains committed version and replay position]
    LE[LittleEndianReader: generic read] --> LV[LittleEndianValue: associated bytes and static conversion]
    ENV[Envelope decoder] --> LE
    SEC[Section table and typed bodies] --> LE
    VER[SnapshotVersion] --> LE

