    OWN[Owned incidence index] --> API[Shared inherent API template; explicit data lifetime]
    VIEW[Borrowed incidence view] --> API
    API --> DATA[IncidenceIndexData: single numerical implementation]
    ACCESS[Four typed record families] --> DECL[Shared iteration/count/containment declarations]
    APPLY[TransactionAssembler.apply] --> RESYNC[ResyncRequired: one abandon boundary]

    TESTS[Assembler cases / taxonomy / model tests] --> RUN[AssemblerRunner owns Producer and consumer]
    RUN --> WIRE[Real wire validation and shared resync assertions]

    GPU[Eight GPU builders] --> FACT[OperationFactory: one context and limits; uniform upload]
    GPU --> CHECK[OperandCheck and GpuTensor binding]
    AST[Node and edge fields] --> DF[DeclarationFields trait]
    DF --> INTERN[AstInterner: one declaration mapping]
    DF --> CONST[ConstValues: one declaration substitution]

    LIVE[IncidenceView: canonical sign and weight] --> COEFF[IncidenceCoefficients]
    PREP[IncidenceOperatorPlan: retained coefficients] --> COEFF
    COEFF --> ROW[IncidenceIndexData: one ordered transpose row]
    ROW --> SERIAL[Shared serial traversal]
    ROW --> PAR[Rayon disjoint node outputs]
